{"title":"Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza (CCAMB)</b> is an annual high school <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_competition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math competition\">math competition</a> organized by Canyon Crest Academy students since 2006.\n</p><p>Students compete in teams of 4, and prizes are awarded to the top performing individuals and teams.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Past_Results\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Results</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Top_Individual\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Top Individual</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Division_I\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Division I</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Division_II\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Division II</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Top_Team\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Top Team</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Division_I_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Division I</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Division_II_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Division II</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Results\">Past Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Past Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>See the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//ccamb.org/archive\">CCAMB contest archive</a> for extended results.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Top_Individual\">Top Individual</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Top Individual\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Division_I\">Division I</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Division I\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li>2015: Evan Liang</li>\n<li>2016: Kevin Ren</li>\n<li>2017: Kevin Ren</li>\n<li>2018: Kevin Ren</li>\n<li>2019: Derek Liu</li>\n<li>2020: Andrew Gu</li>\n<li>2021: Derek Liu</li>\n<li>2022: Derek Liu</li>\n<li>2023: Elliott Liu</li>\n<li>2024: Jacopo Rizzo</li>\n<li>2025: Tiger Zhang</li>\n<li>2026: Kiran She</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Division_II\">Division II</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Division II\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li>2025: Wynn Marple</li>\n<li>2026: Yuyang Mao</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Top_Team\">Top Team</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Top Team\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Division_I_2\">Division I</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Division I\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li>2015: Scripps Ranch High School</li>\n<li>2016: Scripps Ranch High School</li>\n<li>2017: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2018: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2019: Apologies, San Diego</li>\n<li>2020: Orange County Math Circle</li>\n<li>2021: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2022: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2023: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2024: Torrey Pines High School</li>\n<li>2025: University High School</li>\n<li>2026: Torrey Pines High School</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Division_II_2\">Division II</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Division II\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li>2025: Scripps Ranch High School</li>\n<li>2026: Pacific Trails Middle School</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//ccamb.org\">Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//ccamb.org/rules\">Competition Rules and Format</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//ccamb.org/archive\">Past Problems and Results</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075712\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 340/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.310      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.310      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:30113:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018075712 and revision id 285515. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}